{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simulator of an 80s Japanese stock market businessman. Chill, catch a retro vibe and watch your profits grow in the text-based game STONKS-9800.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539140/extras/stonkss.gif?t=1743625263\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy stocks, get dividends, monitor the prices;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your decisions affect the market \u2013 and your life;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep an eye on your health and do not overwork, lest you end up in the hospital;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invest in real estate and cars, increasing your level of comfort;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your company, having a controlling interest;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achieve success as a legal business \u2013 or get rich quickly engaging in shady activities; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a variety of mini-games, including pachinko and horse racing betting </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many other features and unexpected situations await you in <strong>STONKS-9800</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539140/extras/ezgif-3-f20ef3fa0153.gif?t=1743625263\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539140/extras/ezgif-3-55b8c8178cc6.gif?t=1743625263\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539140/extras/ezgif-3-042fd3120ae4.gif?t=1743625263\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539140/extras/ezgif-3-d98ca58b7ca9.gif?t=1743625263\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co